Dialogue: 5,0:01:41.87,0:01:44.33,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,哦，犬嵐！
Dialogue: 5,0:01:44.81,0:01:46.83,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,你上哪兒去了？
Dialogue: 5,0:01:46.83,0:01:48.92,Main-207+,Inuarashi,0,0,0,,怎麼了，錦右衛門？
Dialogue: 5,0:01:49.62,0:01:51.67,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,我們遇上大麻煩了！
Dialogue: 5,0:01:54.03,0:01:58.05,Main-207+,Inuarashi,0,0,0,,敵人知道傳單\N和月亮刺青的事了？！
Dialogue: 5,0:01:58.05,0:02:01.30,Main-207+,Carrot,0,0,0,,沒錯！事情鬧大了！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:02:01.30,0:02:03.89,Main-207+,Carrot,0,0,0,,我們該怎麼辦，殿下？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:02:04.57,0:02:07.70,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,我們一直在暗中散發這些……
Dialogue: 5,0:02:07.70,0:02:10.86,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,我不知道消息是怎麼洩漏的……
Dialogue: 5,0:02:10.86,0:02:16.82,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,我們選用這個暗號\N就是為了防止落入敵人之手。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:02:16.82,0:02:24.17,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,但他們不知怎地\N查出了這與刺青的關聯。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:02:26.16,0:02:27.75,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,此刻在都城裡……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:02:27.75,0:02:33.17,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,凱多和大蛇的手下\N正在逮捕我們的同伴！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:02:34.71,0:02:37.46,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,－你被捕了！\N－你被捕了！
Dialogue: 5,0:02:39.57,0:02:43.14,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,別反抗，反賊！
Dialogue: 5,0:02:43.56,0:02:46.10,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,他身上有傳單！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:02:47.76,0:02:50.35,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,安分點！
Dialogue: 5,0:02:50.35,0:02:52.81,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,他腳上也有月亮刺青！
Dialogue: 5,0:02:53.66,0:02:57.11,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,腳踝上有那個記號的\N都是反賊！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:02:57.87,0:03:00.05,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,看到就通報！
Dialogue: 5,0:03:05.50,0:03:07.67,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,消息傳得真快。
Dialogue: 5,0:03:07.67,0:03:10.50,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,現在整個都城恐怕都聽說了。
Dialogue: 5,0:03:10.50,0:03:14.48,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,巡查澡堂\N只是白費工夫。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:03:15.21,0:03:17.47,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,你倒是走運。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:03:17.47,0:03:19.09,Main-207+,Drake,0,0,0,,這話什麼意思？
Dialogue: 5,0:03:25.16,0:03:28.47,Flashbacks-207+,Drake,0,0,0,,真不愧是漆黑隱伏……！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:03:28.47,0:03:30.14,Flashbacks-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,450)\t(1198,1670,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}下次一定抓到他！
Dialogue: 5,0:03:30.69,0:03:33.99,Main-207+,Drake,0,0,0,,讓他們跑了\N你也有責任。
Dialogue: 5,0:03:39.07,0:03:42.03,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,啊，小紫……！
Dialogue: 5,0:03:55.00,0:03:57.38,Main-207+,Gang Member,0,0,0,,狂死郎老大……
Dialogue: 5,0:03:57.96,0:04:01.26,Main-207+,Gang Member,0,0,0,,小紫的守靈已經取消了。
Dialogue: 5,0:04:01.26,0:04:06.47,Main-207+,Gang Member,0,0,0,,要是這麼多悲痛的人湧進來\N場面恐怕會失控。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:04:07.97,0:04:12.68,Main-207+,Gang Member,0,0,0,,明天的葬禮\N大概會更加擁擠。
Dialogue: 5,0:04:13.58,0:04:16.52,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,願她安息！
Dialogue: 5,0:04:16.52,0:04:21.27,Main-207+,Gang Member,0,0,0,,許多人把這件事\N歸咎到您身上……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:04:21.94,0:04:23.65,Main-207+,Gang Member,0,0,0,,請多加小心。
Dialogue: 5,0:04:24.72,0:04:27.20,Main-207+,Denjiro,0,0,0,,他們管好自己就行了。
Dialogue: 5,0:04:32.37,0:04:36.58,Main-207+,Denjiro,0,0,0,,當時別無他法……
Dialogue: 5,0:04:36.58,0:04:40.58,Main-207+,Denjiro,0,0,0,,損失最大的人……
Dialogue: 5,0:04:40.58,0:04:41.96,Main-207+,Denjiro,0,0,0,,是我。
Dialogue: 5,0:04:42.72,0:04:44.25,Main-207+,Gang Member,0,0,0,,的確。
Dialogue: 5,0:04:50.26,0:04:54.37,Main-207+,Denjiro,0,0,0,,大蛇大人還在氣頭上。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:04:54.37,0:04:58.14,Main-207+,Denjiro,0,0,0,,我敢說{\i1}這{\i0}正是他的心頭刺。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:05:06.90,0:05:08.90,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,你們兩個別吵了！
Dialogue: 5,0:05:08.90,0:05:11.87,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,爭吵解決不了任何事！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:05:13.08,0:05:15.00,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,我們是同一陣線的！
Dialogue: 5,0:05:17.25,0:05:21.82,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,他們正在逮捕所有\N認同我們鏟除大蛇目標的人……
Dialogue: 5,0:05:23.00,0:05:26.18,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,全是因為你的船員出了紕漏！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:05:26.99,0:05:28.06,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,你說什麼？！
Dialogue: 5,0:05:28.06,0:05:30.64,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,那隻小熊和他的同伴……
Dialogue: 5,0:05:30.64,0:05:33.97,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,一定把計畫供出去了！
Dialogue: 5,0:05:35.18,0:05:40.69,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,貝波他們寧死也不會招供！\N別小看他們！
Dialogue: 5,0:05:41.76,0:05:45.31,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,等等！你這樣正中敵人下懷，特拉！
Dialogue: 5,0:05:45.31,0:05:49.20,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,輪不到你來指揮我，黑腳！
Dialogue: 5,0:05:49.20,0:05:52.41,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,你們兩個都冷靜點。
Dialogue: 5,0:05:53.12,0:05:56.74,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,該冷靜的是你才對！
Dialogue: 5,0:05:57.71,0:05:59.26,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,你們必須……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:05:59.26,0:06:01.86,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,你們必須彼此信任！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:06:01.86,0:06:04.58,Main-207+,Nami,0,0,0,,你是我認識最不可信的人！
Dialogue: 5,0:06:08.85,0:06:11.27,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\t(0,440,1,\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}我什麼都沒看見……
Dialogue: 5,0:06:11.27,0:06:15.27,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,才挨幾拳\N你的臉怎麼變成那樣……？{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:06:16.82,0:06:17.94,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,你想逃跑嗎？！
Dialogue: 5,0:06:17.94,0:06:21.60,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,我們得除掉那些\N被抓的人！
Dialogue: 5,0:06:22.11,0:06:23.40,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,必須讓他們閉嘴！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:06:23.40,0:06:24.77,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,你說什麼？！
Dialogue: 5,0:06:24.77,0:06:27.51,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,這就是忍者世界的法則！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:06:27.51,0:06:29.68,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,妳好可怕，忍！
Dialogue: 5,0:06:33.29,0:06:36.42,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,這可不是在玩遊戲！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:06:41.81,0:06:46.01,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,我們已經等了\N二十年才等到這一刻！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:06:46.01,0:06:50.42,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,一旦失敗，就再也沒有機會了！
Dialogue: 5,0:06:54.63,0:06:57.09,Main-207+,Kanjuro,0,0,0,,夠了，忍！
Dialogue: 5,0:06:58.61,0:07:00.32,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,勘！大人！
Dialogue: 5,0:07:02.16,0:07:04.90,Main-207+,Kanjuro,0,0,0,,事情不總是按計畫進行的！
Dialogue: 5,0:07:04.90,0:07:07.10,Main-207+,Kanjuro,0,0,0,,我很明白你的沮喪……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:07:07.10,0:07:12.87,Main-207+,Kanjuro,0,0,0,,但能找到目標與我們一致的同伴\N已是奇蹟！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:07:12.87,0:07:17.24,Main-207+,Kanjuro,0,0,0,,沒有他們，御田大人的遺願\N永遠無法實現！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:07:21.83,0:07:24.37,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,打擾了！恕我冒昧！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:07:24.37,0:07:27.86,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,我在外頭不小心聽見了！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:07:28.98,0:07:31.28,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,你們的嗓音真好聽！
Dialogue: 5,0:07:31.28,0:07:33.57,Main-207+,Nami,0,0,0,,站住！你是誰？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:07:33.57,0:07:34.84,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 5,0:07:35.58,0:07:39.31,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,哇！好美！簡直是女神！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:07:40.46,0:07:41.51,Main-207+,Nami,0,0,0,,哦，你這人！
Dialogue: 5,0:07:41.51,0:07:43.82,Main-207+,Nami,0,0,0,,請進吧。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:07:43.82,0:07:46.82,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,哦，多謝款待。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:07:46.82,0:07:47.52,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 5,0:07:50.25,0:07:51.37,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,我沒看錯吧……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:07:51.37,0:07:54.08,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,小忍？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:07:56.54,0:07:58.21,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,勘十郎少爺！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:07:58.96,0:08:03.27,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,哦，原來如此，原來如此！
Dialogue: 5,0:08:03.27,0:08:07.58,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,那麼我手上這個\N就是真貨了，對吧？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:08:07.58,0:08:11.29,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,都城裡人人都在談論這件事！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:08:11.29,0:08:14.17,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,我興奮得按捺不住！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:08:14.96,0:08:19.10,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,是要開始了嗎？！那場大戰？！
Dialogue: 5,0:08:36.17,0:08:37.49,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我的刀……
Dialogue: 5,0:08:37.49,0:08:39.32,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我的刀！
Dialogue: 5,0:08:44.49,0:08:46.22,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,你是……
Dialogue: 5,0:08:46.22,0:08:48.97,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,你嚇了我一跳！
Dialogue: 5,0:08:49.51,0:08:52.33,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,請別亂動……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:08:53.86,0:08:55.72,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,會扯到你的傷口……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:08:55.72,0:08:59.21,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,她說得對！你先別急著起來！
Dialogue: 5,0:09:00.55,0:09:02.40,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,這是哪裡？
Dialogue: 5,0:09:09.11,0:09:15.44,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,你剛才救了我們的命。\N真是太感謝了。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:09:18.07,0:09:20.05,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,謝謝你！
Dialogue: 5,0:09:21.47,0:09:24.49,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,但結果你卻受了重傷！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:09:25.03,0:09:28.76,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我真的……不知該如何賠罪。
Dialogue: 5,0:09:30.79,0:09:33.97,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我受傷是我自己的錯。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:09:33.97,0:09:36.14,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,你沒什麼好賠罪的……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:09:37.96,0:09:41.05,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,那傢伙跑哪去了？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:09:41.05,0:09:43.34,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,秋水還在他手上！
Dialogue: 5,0:09:43.77,0:09:46.90,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,傷成這樣，請別出去！
Dialogue: 5,0:09:46.90,0:09:48.21,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,好痛！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:09:48.21,0:09:51.50,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,那是我受傷的那側，你這笨蛋！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:09:51.50,0:09:52.52,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,對不起！
Dialogue: 5,0:09:52.52,0:09:54.32,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,真是的……！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:09:54.32,0:09:55.98,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我走了！
Dialogue: 5,0:09:56.57,0:10:00.32,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,別走！你的傷還沒好！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:00.32,0:10:01.98,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,痛痛痛痛！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:01.98,0:10:05.08,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我剛說了那是我受傷的手臂！\N給我注意點！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:10:05.08,0:10:06.84,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,對、對不起！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:10.02,0:10:12.29,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,痛、痛、痛……
Dialogue: 5,0:10:12.29,0:10:14.64,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,沒事的，武士先生！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:14.64,0:10:16.36,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,你很快就會好起來的！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:16.36,0:10:20.11,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,我在都城偷了這蛤蟆油藥膏……
Dialogue: 5,0:10:20.72,0:10:22.03,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,不對，是我買的！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:22.03,0:10:23.51,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,妳偷的。
Dialogue: 5,0:10:23.51,0:10:25.09,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,才、才沒有。
Dialogue: 5,0:10:26.37,0:10:28.27,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,算了，我不在乎。
Dialogue: 5,0:10:28.27,0:10:30.31,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,這蛤蟆油可神奇了！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:30.94,0:10:33.98,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,能讓刀傷消失呢！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:33.98,0:10:38.37,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,蛤蟆油啊？但願有用吧！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:10:40.33,0:10:42.99,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,喂，武士先生！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:10:45.79,0:10:47.58,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,別丟下我們！
Dialogue: 5,0:10:50.52,0:10:52.26,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,有東西吃嗎？
Dialogue: 5,0:10:52.26,0:10:54.79,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,有！你現在想吃點嗎？！
Dialogue: 5,0:11:02.39,0:11:03.42,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,牛鬼丸？
Dialogue: 5,0:11:03.42,0:11:05.54,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,沒、沒錯。
Dialogue: 5,0:11:07.11,0:11:11.60,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,整座城都知道\N「盜賊橋的牛鬼丸」。
Dialogue: 5,0:11:12.22,0:11:17.40,Flashbacks-207+,Onimaru,0,0,0,,名刀秋水\N已經物歸原處了。
Dialogue: 5,0:11:17.40,0:11:24.40,Flashbacks-207+,Onimaru,0,0,0,,{\t(6350,6987,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}那是從和之國傳說中的武士\N龍馬墓中被盜走的寶物！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:11:24.49,0:11:27.35,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,沒人知道他住在哪裡，{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:11:27.35,0:11:32.71,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,但任何帶著武器\N想過橋的人他都會攔下。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:11:34.24,0:11:39.08,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,啊，這麼說他一直在那兒？\N那就不急了……
Dialogue: 5,0:11:39.08,0:11:42.42,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我還是對牛鬼丸挺好奇的，
Dialogue: 5,0:11:42.42,0:11:44.76,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,不過先說說，你們兩個是誰？
Dialogue: 5,0:11:44.76,0:11:48.34,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,那個長得像死神的傢伙\N為什麼要追你們？{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:11:57.47,0:12:02.45,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,那是因為我們觸怒了\N和之國的將軍。
Dialogue: 5,0:12:02.45,0:12:04.17,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,將軍啊？
Dialogue: 5,0:12:04.17,0:12:06.41,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,大……大蜥蜴？
Dialogue: 5,0:12:06.41,0:12:07.78,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,是大蛇。
Dialogue: 5,0:12:07.78,0:12:10.33,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,喂，武士先生！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:12:11.22,0:12:13.04,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,我叫托子！
Dialogue: 5,0:12:13.04,0:12:16.41,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,加上「阿」的敬稱\N就變成「阿托子」，也就是「男人」的意思。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:12:17.59,0:12:19.87,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,很好笑吧？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:12:19.87,0:12:21.03,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,不，還好。
Dialogue: 5,0:12:21.03,0:12:22.96,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,咦？咦？！
Dialogue: 5,0:12:23.75,0:12:27.60,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,大家都說好笑！\N你為什麼不覺得？！
Dialogue: 5,0:12:27.60,0:12:28.81,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我哪知道。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:12:31.75,0:12:35.56,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,雖然你穿著\N和之國武士的衣裝，
Dialogue: 5,0:12:35.56,0:12:37.65,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,但你其實是來自海外的吧？{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:12:37.65,0:12:40.47,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,你看起來不像壞……
Dialogue: 5,0:12:41.51,0:12:42.49,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,壞……
Dialogue: 5,0:12:44.15,0:12:44.94,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,壞人。
Dialogue: 5,0:12:44.94,0:12:46.99,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,快說出來啊！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:12:46.20,0:12:46.99,Secondary-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,抱歉！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:12:47.97,0:12:50.69,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,武士先生，你挺嚇人的！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:12:50.69,0:12:54.83,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,但你救了我們，\N所以你是個大好人！
Dialogue: 5,0:13:13.02,0:13:13.76,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,那個……
Dialogue: 5,0:13:15.16,0:13:18.56,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我想告訴你一個秘密，\N但你得答應為我保密。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:13:21.65,0:13:22.73,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,是什麼？
Dialogue: 5,0:13:22.73,0:13:26.72,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我……在尋找我的哥哥。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:13:26.72,0:13:29.42,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我們二十年前分開了……
Dialogue: 5,0:13:33.49,0:13:37.38,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,而現在，我想他可能就在和之國！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:13:38.13,0:13:40.71,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,他的名字是……
Dialogue: 5,0:13:40.71,0:13:42.68,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,光月桃之助。
Dialogue: 5,0:13:44.14,0:13:45.74,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我是他的妹妹。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:13:49.16,0:13:50.92,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我叫日和！
Dialogue: 5,0:13:55.46,0:13:58.18,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,桃之助的{\i1}妹妹{\i0}？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:13:59.27,0:14:00.23,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我就知道！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:14:00.23,0:14:02.99,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我很慶幸自己\N鼓起勇氣告訴了你！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:14:04.27,0:14:06.16,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我也算是賭了一把。
Dialogue: 5,0:14:07.52,0:14:09.49,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,你{\i1}確實{\i0}認識我哥哥，對吧？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:14:10.18,0:14:11.90,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,而且他平安無事，對吧？！
Dialogue: 5,0:14:11.90,0:14:14.13,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,等等！妳冷靜點！
Dialogue: 5,0:14:14.13,0:14:16.08,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我得理一理思緒。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:14:17.83,0:14:21.48,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,最近到處都在傳\N光月家即將歸來的消息。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:14:22.08,0:14:27.54,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,恰好有位來自海外、\N強大又善良的武士出現了。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:14:27.54,0:14:29.67,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我想他也許是我哥哥的同伴！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:14:31.18,0:14:34.90,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,還是說你是想追查他下落的敵人？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:14:34.90,0:14:36.02,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我是他的同伴。
Dialogue: 5,0:14:37.68,0:14:39.32,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我絕對是他的同伴。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:14:40.82,0:14:42.36,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我太安心了。
Dialogue: 5,0:14:44.11,0:14:47.65,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,你知道錦右衛門是否還活著嗎？
Dialogue: 5,0:14:49.67,0:14:54.75,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,勘十郎、雷藏和菊之丞都跟他在一起嗎？
Dialogue: 5,0:14:54.75,0:14:56.28,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,菊之丞？
Dialogue: 5,0:14:57.50,0:14:59.24,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,哦，妳是說阿菊？
Dialogue: 5,0:14:59.24,0:15:03.47,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,對，不過等等……有件事說不通。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:15:03.47,0:15:06.25,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,妳真的是桃的妹妹嗎？
Dialogue: 5,0:15:09.28,0:15:10.93,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,讓我解釋。
Dialogue: 5,0:15:13.88,0:15:15.43,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,原來如此。
Dialogue: 5,0:15:15.43,0:15:17.51,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,沒錯。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:15:17.51,0:15:21.40,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,二十年前的桃\N看起來只有八歲，
Dialogue: 5,0:15:21.40,0:15:24.69,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,而妳理應是他的妹妹，
Dialogue: 5,0:15:24.69,0:15:27.36,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,但妳長了二十歲，\N如今已經二十六了……
Dialogue: 5,0:15:27.36,0:15:28.53,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,是的。
Dialogue: 5,0:15:28.53,0:15:29.84,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,對了……
Dialogue: 5,0:15:31.08,0:15:31.62,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 5,0:15:32.04,0:15:34.54,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,……讓她聽這些沒關係嗎？{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:15:35.02,0:15:38.02,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,沒關係，因為我早就知道了！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:15:40.08,0:15:43.27,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,這是我和姊姊之間的秘密！
Dialogue: 5,0:15:43.27,0:15:47.84,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,阿托子是少數幾個\N知道我真實身份的密友之一。
Dialogue: 5,0:15:49.02,0:15:53.17,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,她的開朗\N支撐著我度過每一天……
Dialogue: 5,0:15:53.17,0:15:58.56,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,二十年前，我也\N還是個像她一樣的小女孩……
Dialogue: 5,0:15:59.81,0:16:03.89,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,但我永遠忘不了\N那天發生的事。
Dialogue: 5,0:16:09.23,0:16:12.24,Flashbacks-207+,Toki,0,0,0,,你們必須逃……逃向未來！
Dialogue: 5,0:16:14.58,0:16:17.58,Flashbacks-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,母親，求您別這麼做！
Dialogue: 5,0:16:17.58,0:16:21.21,Flashbacks-207+,Momonosuke,0,0,0,,{\t(2730,3330,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}母親！母親！
Dialogue: 5,0:16:23.76,0:16:27.16,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我完全搞不懂\N當時發生了什麼。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:16:28.01,0:16:30.59,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,在熊熊烈火中，
Dialogue: 5,0:16:30.59,0:16:35.21,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我哥哥和其他人\N就在我眼前消失了……
Dialogue: 5,0:16:37.71,0:16:40.85,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,就在同一天\N我失去了父親御田，{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:16:40.85,0:16:42.39,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,甚至還有我的母親……
Dialogue: 5,0:16:42.96,0:16:45.58,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,一天之內，我驟然失去了一切。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:16:46.46,0:16:49.80,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,有人告訴我，我哥哥\N會在二十年後歸來……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:16:50.46,0:16:55.55,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,但面對如此渺茫的事，\N我的希望轉瞬即逝……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:16:56.82,0:17:00.66,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,那些年裡，\N我幾乎失去了活下去的意志。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:17:02.02,0:17:04.96,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,妳為什麼沒有一起穿越到未來？{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:17:05.58,0:17:10.67,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,為了以防哥哥或我\N其中一人遭遇不測……
Dialogue: 5,0:17:10.67,0:17:13.84,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,他們不願光月的血脈就此斷絕。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:17:13.84,0:17:16.84,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,這太殘忍了……
Dialogue: 5,0:17:16.84,0:17:20.43,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,但我父親的家臣，
Dialogue: 5,0:17:20.43,0:17:26.27,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,河童河松給了我精神上的支持，\N耐心地把我養大。
Dialogue: 5,0:17:26.27,0:17:27.23,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\i1}河童{\i0}？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:17:27.23,0:17:28.61,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,沒錯。
Dialogue: 5,0:17:28.61,0:17:34.91,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,很難相信真有這種生物存在，\N但他為身為河童感到非常自豪。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:17:35.86,0:17:39.51,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,城堡起火的那天，\N我們被敵人包圍，
Dialogue: 5,0:17:39.51,0:17:44.41,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,但我們神不知鬼不覺地\N從護城河的排水道逃了出來。
Dialogue: 5,0:17:44.41,0:17:47.25,Main-207+,Kawamatsu,0,0,0,,公主！請您忍耐！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:17:50.99,0:17:54.63,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,在失去父親、母親和哥哥之後，
Dialogue: 5,0:17:54.63,0:18:00.10,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我因太過震驚而說不出話，\N但他始終樂觀地支持著我。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:18:00.10,0:18:03.38,Flashbacks-207+,Kawamatsu,0,0,0,,公主！這是河童舞！
Dialogue: 5,0:18:03.38,0:18:08.18,Flashbacks-207+,Kawamatsu,0,0,0,,♪ 來吧！河童趴、河童趴、♪\N♪ 河童趴趴趴！♪
Dialogue: 5,0:18:08.18,0:18:10.31,Flashbacks-207+,Kawamatsu,0,0,0,,♪ 河童趴、河童趴…… ♪
Dialogue: 5,0:18:10.31,0:18:13.95,Flashbacks-207+,Kawamatsu,0,0,0,,公主，您儘管吃。
Dialogue: 5,0:18:18.60,0:18:21.07,Flashbacks-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,河松，你也餓了吧？{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:18:21.07,0:18:27.54,Flashbacks-207+,Kawamatsu,0,0,0,,不，我肚子不舒服。\N所以才咕咕叫的。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:18:28.04,0:18:32.26,Flashbacks-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,求你……至少吃一半吧。
Dialogue: 5,0:18:32.26,0:18:37.13,Flashbacks-207+,Kawamatsu,0,0,0,,不用，我沒事。我剛才在河裡\N發現一條烤魚游過。
Dialogue: 5,0:18:41.68,0:18:43.56,Flashbacks-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,河裡有烤魚？
Dialogue: 5,0:18:43.56,0:18:44.64,Flashbacks-207+,Kawamatsu,0,0,0,,沒錯！
Dialogue: 5,0:18:45.27,0:18:50.31,Flashbacks-207+,Kawamatsu,0,0,0,,所以我三兩下把牠切了，路上就吃掉了。
Dialogue: 5,0:18:51.78,0:18:56.37,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,350)}他自己吃得很少，\N卻拚了命地餵飽我。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:18:57.24,0:19:02.18,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,多虧盡職守護我的河松\N那份善意，{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:19:02.18,0:19:05.24,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我漸漸重新學會了歡笑。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:19:06.21,0:19:07.91,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,這傢伙現在在哪？{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:19:08.70,0:19:12.57,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我想大概在我十三歲時，
Dialogue: 5,0:19:12.57,0:19:13.96,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我們就分開了……
Dialogue: 5,0:19:14.56,0:19:19.60,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,但河松是個強大的武士，
Dialogue: 5,0:19:19.60,0:19:24.84,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,所以他一定還在某處，\N等待著大戰之日的到來！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:19:25.57,0:19:28.47,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我多希望能再見到他和大家……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:19:28.47,0:19:30.47,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,我也想見見{\i1}河童{\i0}！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:19:33.33,0:19:34.30,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,嗯哼！
Dialogue: 5,0:19:35.21,0:19:36.14,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,索隆十郎……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:19:37.45,0:19:42.40,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,還有誰在為大戰做準備？{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:19:42.40,0:19:44.86,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,這個嘛，我想想……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:19:44.86,0:19:46.67,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 5,0:19:46.67,0:19:49.83,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,那麼汪汪和喵喵也在準備了？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:19:49.83,0:19:50.70,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,對。
Dialogue: 5,0:19:50.70,0:19:56.16,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我聽說他們倆都死了，\N還以為再也見不到了！
Dialogue: 5,0:19:56.16,0:20:00.60,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,貓蝮蛇可能還沒到和之國……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:20:04.01,0:20:05.64,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,妳在做什麼？
Dialogue: 5,0:20:05.64,0:20:07.84,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我真的、真的好開心……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:20:14.23,0:20:16.06,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,妳真逗，姊姊！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:20:20.47,0:20:22.22,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,但我不會哭的！
Dialogue: 5,0:20:23.08,0:20:25.28,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我是武士的女兒！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:20:25.28,0:20:28.27,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,如果汪汪和喵喵都會到場，{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:20:28.27,0:20:32.67,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,那麼紅鞘九人眾\N就有可能全員集結！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:20:32.67,0:20:34.62,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,這我可就不敢肯定了。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:20:34.62,0:20:36.07,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,8,,錦右衛門。
Dialogue: 5,0:20:37.03,0:20:38.36,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,8,,勘十郎。
Dialogue: 5,0:20:39.35,0:20:40.85,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,8,,雷藏。
Dialogue: 5,0:20:41.78,0:20:43.51,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,8,,阿菊。
Dialogue: 5,0:20:44.36,0:20:45.80,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,8,,犬嵐。
Dialogue: 5,0:20:46.92,0:20:48.39,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,8,,貓蝮蛇。
Dialogue: 5,0:20:52.38,0:20:57.36,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,8,,目前確定的只有這六人和桃之助。
Dialogue: 5,0:20:57.36,0:21:00.95,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,8,,剩下的三人我們還沒見到。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:00.95,0:21:05.12,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,8,,三人中的第一位，河松，\N我剛才提過了，{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:05.12,0:21:07.54,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,8,,還有傳二郎和阿修羅童子。
Dialogue: 5,0:21:07.54,0:21:13.53,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我不知道他們在哪，\N也不知是否平安……
Dialogue: 5,0:21:14.69,0:21:19.42,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,但如今整座都城\N都因這傳單而騷動……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:19.42,0:21:21.88,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我就知道他們一定會現身！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:21.88,0:21:25.63,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,那就是我們發給反抗軍的傳單嗎？
Dialogue: 5,0:21:25.63,0:21:26.96,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,是的。
Dialogue: 5,0:21:26.96,0:21:33.05,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,多虧這場騷動，消息傳得飛快，\N照理說是件好事，
Dialogue: 5,0:21:33.05,0:21:35.51,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,但這其實讓我們陷入了困境……
Dialogue: 5,0:21:35.51,0:21:39.58,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,因為集合地點暴露了，\N同伴也被抓了。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:40.45,0:21:42.94,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,情況有些不妙。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:42.94,0:21:44.69,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,會沒事的。
Dialogue: 5,0:21:45.57,0:21:48.07,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我是這麼相信的。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:48.07,0:21:48.65,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,這個嘛……
Dialogue: 5,0:21:51.70,0:21:57.50,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,船頭多了會翻船。\N我不瞎操心了。
Dialogue: 5,0:21:57.50,0:21:59.06,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,哦，是的！當然！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:21:59.06,0:22:03.00,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,最重要的是，我希望你先養好傷！
Dialogue: 5,0:22:03.00,0:22:05.36,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,現在好好休息吧。
Dialogue: 5,0:22:05.36,0:22:07.81,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,嗯，不用妳說第二遍……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:22:10.75,0:22:12.49,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,阿托子，這真是個奇蹟！
Dialogue: 5,0:22:12.49,0:22:13.72,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我欣喜若狂！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:22:14.80,0:22:17.22,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我哥哥還活著！
Dialogue: 5,0:22:18.60,0:22:20.85,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,我真為妳高興，姊姊！
Dialogue: 5,0:22:24.10,0:22:26.41,Main-207+,Toko,0,0,0,,我真為妳高興，姊姊！
Dialogue: 5,0:22:26.41,0:22:27.98,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,托子，這太好了！
Dialogue: 5,0:22:31.63,0:22:35.16,Thoughts-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,她們就不能小聲點嗎？\N這還讓不讓人睡了！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:22:41.16,0:22:42.71,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,但他才八歲！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:22:42.71,0:22:44.58,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,真是奇妙。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:22:45.11,0:22:47.67,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我哥哥還是個孩子。
Dialogue: 5,0:22:47.67,0:22:51.68,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我想錦右衛門他們\N這二十年來也沒變吧。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:22:51.68,0:22:55.48,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我不禁想像\N我們重逢時會是什麼光景。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:22:55.48,0:22:59.20,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,或許在大戰之前\N不與他們相見更好。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:22:59.20,0:23:03.65,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,我不該插手武士的戰鬥。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:23:03.65,0:23:05.44,Main-207+,Hiyori,0,0,0,,對吧，阿托子？{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:23:29.78,0:23:34.02,Main-207+,Fukurokuju,0,0,0,,沒想到抓到了這麼多暴徒！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:23:34.02,0:23:38.22,Main-207+,Fukurokuju,0,0,0,,各位，好好看清楚他們！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:23:38.22,0:23:46.15,Main-207+,Fukurokuju,0,0,0,,好好看看這些膽敢起兵\N反抗大蛇將軍和凱多大人的蠢貨的臉！
Dialogue: 5,0:23:51.74,0:23:53.49,Main-207+,Official,0,0,0,,快給我進去！
Dialogue: 5,0:23:58.93,0:24:00.75,Main-207+,Fukurokuju,0,0,0,,算你們倒楣。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:24:00.75,0:24:04.08,Main-207+,Fukurokuju,0,0,0,,你們敗露了，陰謀被識破了！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:24:04.77,0:24:06.54,Main-207+,Fukurokuju,0,0,0,,你們失敗了。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:24:06.54,0:24:09.20,Main-207+,Kojuro,0,0,0,,福祿壽大人，請等等！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:24:09.20,0:24:13.34,Main-207+,Kojuro,0,0,0,,您憑什麼認為\N這腳踝刺青就代表我們是反賊？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:24:13.34,0:24:17.80,Main-207+,Kojuro,0,0,0,,這只是個流行的圖案！我們\N跟什麼謀反根本毫無關係！
Dialogue: 5,0:24:17.80,0:24:22.51,Main-207+,Fukurokuju,0,0,0,,少廢話！那你怎麼解釋\N這張傳單？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:24:24.04,0:24:28.51,Main-207+,Fukurokuju,0,0,0,,{\q2}正中央是個倒新月？
Dialogue: 5,0:24:28.51,0:24:33.98,Main-207+,Fukurokuju,0,0,0,,這莫非是反抗\N大蛇將軍的謀反標誌？
Dialogue: 5,0:24:33.98,0:24:37.16,Main-207+,Fukurokuju,0,0,0,,跟你們的刺青一模一樣。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:24:37.72,0:24:42.12,Main-207+,Fukurokuju,0,0,0,,這是大蛇將軍下的命令，\N所以給我坐下閉嘴！
Dialogue: 5,0:24:54.06,0:24:56.09,Main-207+,Shachi,0,0,0,,我們攤上大麻煩了……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:24:56.09,0:24:58.30,Main-207+,Penguin,0,0,0,,大家會不會以為……
Dialogue: 5,0:24:59.96,0:25:02.69,Main-207+,Penguin,0,0,0,,是我們把計畫洩漏出去的？{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:25:05.47,0:25:06.56,Main-207+,Bepo,0,0,0,,別擔心……
Dialogue: 5,0:25:06.56,0:25:10.90,Main-207+,Bepo,0,0,0,,船長會繼續相信我們的……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:25:26.67,0:25:32.13,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,快啊，快啊！\N趕緊把他們打趴啊！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:25:36.14,0:25:38.92,Main-207+,Kawamatsu,0,0,0,,我也好想參加相撲比賽……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:25:38.92,0:25:45.52,Main-207+,Madilloman,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(960,225.6)}我是犰狳人！吃了\N犰狳SMILE果實的給賦者！
Dialogue: 5,0:25:50.11,0:25:53.26,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,哦，你看起來身板挺硬的！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:25:53.26,0:25:54.74,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,正好拿來訓練！
Dialogue: 5,0:25:54.74,0:25:56.19,Main-207+,Madilloman,0,0,0,,你這蠢貨！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:25:56.19,0:26:00.75,Main-207+,Madilloman,0,0,0,,我這寶貝裡裝的可是海樓石子彈！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:26:03.36,0:26:05.91,Main-207+,Madilloman,0,0,0,,你們完蛋了，小子們！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:26:07.49,0:26:09.13,Main-207+,Queen,0,0,0,,他們「完蛋了」？
Dialogue: 5,0:26:09.13,0:26:14.75,Main-207+,Queen,0,0,0,,這些蠢貨眼睛瞎了嗎？！\N根本還沒「完蛋」。
Dialogue: 5,0:26:16.27,0:26:17.18,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,老爺子！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:26:17.18,0:26:20.21,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,往右，蹲下，然後跳。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:26:20.21,0:26:20.92,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,啊？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:26:20.92,0:26:22.14,Main-207+,Madilloman,0,0,0,,去死吧！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:26:22.14,0:26:22.94,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 5,0:26:22.94,0:26:23.80,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 5,0:26:24.80,0:26:26.26,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,「往右」！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:26:27.22,0:26:28.22,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,「蹲下」！
Dialogue: 5,0:26:28.22,0:26:30.40,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,然後……
Dialogue: 5,0:26:29.60,0:26:30.39,Secondary-207+,Alpacaman,0,0,0,,你這小子……！
Dialogue: 5,0:26:30.40,0:26:31.56,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,……「跳」！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:26:39.62,0:26:41.82,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,－什麼？！\N－什麼？！
Dialogue: 5,0:26:41.82,0:26:43.82,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,痛、痛、痛……
Dialogue: 5,0:26:44.91,0:26:46.79,Main-207+,Alpacaman,0,0,0,,可惡、可惡、可惡、可惡、可惡、可惡！
Dialogue: 5,0:26:48.84,0:26:51.04,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,幹得好，老爺子！繼續！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:26:51.04,0:26:55.42,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,搞什麼……？！你難道\N能預知未來嗎？{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:26:55.42,0:26:56.76,Main-207+,Madilloman,0,0,0,,去你的！
Dialogue: 5,0:26:56.76,0:27:01.67,Main-207+,Madilloman,0,0,0,,簡直胡說八道！\N你到底做了什麼？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:27:08.31,0:27:10.19,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,老爺子！接下來往左！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:27:10.19,0:27:10.94,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 5,0:27:10.94,0:27:12.56,Main-207+,Madilloman,0,0,0,,你這傢伙……！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:27:12.56,0:27:14.14,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,「往左」！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:27:15.53,0:27:18.31,Main-207+,Alpacaman,0,0,0,,可惡，這老頭！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:27:18.31,0:27:19.61,Main-207+,Alpacaman,0,0,0,,嚐嚐這個！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:27:24.50,0:27:27.62,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,「往左」！「往左」！「往左」！「往左」！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:27:30.89,0:27:32.13,Main-207+,Alpacaman,0,0,0,,你這小騙子！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:27:36.09,0:27:37.22,Main-207+,Madilloman,0,0,0,,正中紅心！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:27:44.45,0:27:46.56,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,槍是打不倒我的！
Dialogue: 5,0:27:47.89,0:27:50.69,Main-207+,Madilloman,0,0,0,,你、你這狡猾的小子……！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:27:58.58,0:28:01.28,Main-207+,Madilloman,0,0,0,,還沒完呢！
Dialogue: 5,0:28:01.95,0:28:04.08,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,不碰到他就把他打飛！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:28:10.58,0:28:11.89,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,不是這樣。
Dialogue: 5,0:28:11.89,0:28:13.91,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,那只是普通的武裝色……
Dialogue: 5,0:28:17.13,0:28:18.97,Main-207+,Madilloman,0,0,0,,糟了！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:28:20.01,0:28:21.92,Main-207+,Madilloman,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}犰狳防禦！
Dialogue: 5,0:28:25.93,0:28:26.98,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,不是這樣……
Dialogue: 5,0:28:26.98,0:28:29.97,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,這還是普通的武裝色而已……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:28:29.97,0:28:32.24,Main-207+,Madilloman,0,0,0,,咦？！你不是要打我嗎？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:28:33.93,0:28:37.01,Main-207+,Alpacaman,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}羊駝劍術！
Dialogue: 5,0:28:37.01,0:28:39.69,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,喂！接下來往哪邊？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:28:39.69,0:28:43.07,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,草帽大人！
Dialogue: 5,0:28:43.07,0:28:45.16,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,好！就停在那兒！
Dialogue: 5,0:28:45.16,0:28:46.44,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,這樣行嗎？！
Dialogue: 5,0:28:51.35,0:28:53.20,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,這樣會更輕鬆！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:28:53.20,0:28:55.12,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,真是抱歉……！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:28:55.12,0:28:57.23,Main-207+,Madilloman,0,0,0,,你隨時可以來，羊駝人！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:28:57.23,0:28:58.36,Main-207+,Alpacaman,0,0,0,,放馬過來！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:28:59.71,0:29:05.06,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,放我下來！\N這樣拖累你可不行！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:29:06.16,0:29:09.51,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,不。其實越重越好。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:29:09.51,0:29:10.68,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 5,0:29:15.36,0:29:17.10,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,這對我的訓練有幫助！
Dialogue: 5,0:29:22.42,0:29:24.69,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,原來如此，原來如此……！
Dialogue: 5,0:29:26.45,0:29:32.53,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,這張傳單告訴了我們\N即將到來的大戰所需的一切！
Dialogue: 5,0:29:32.53,0:29:38.26,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,兩隻著火的鳥……那代表\N火祭當天的黃昏！
Dialogue: 5,0:29:38.26,0:29:42.54,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,突襲的集合地點是波布港！
Dialogue: 5,0:29:43.19,0:29:46.81,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,錦右衛門少爺為此\N肯定絞盡了腦汁。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:29:47.65,0:29:49.84,Main-207+,Shinobu,0,0,0,,錦右衛門……少爺？{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:29:50.76,0:29:53.75,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,哦，你們幹嘛用那種眼神看我，{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:29:53.75,0:29:55.27,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,小忍？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:29:57.42,0:30:01.95,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,原來是這麼回事。你們臉上\N那副沮喪的表情，我全明白了。
Dialogue: 5,0:30:01.95,0:30:05.01,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,這計畫等於是毀了，{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:30:05.01,0:30:07.99,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,畢竟敵人已經知情了。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:30:08.76,0:30:11.74,Main-207+,Kanjuro,0,0,0,,嗯哼。正是如此……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:30:12.26,0:30:16.37,Main-207+,Kanjuro,0,0,0,,身上有倒新月刺青\N——也就是我們謀反標誌——的同伴，{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:30:16.37,0:30:18.71,Main-207+,Kanjuro,0,0,0,,如今正被一一抓捕。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:30:21.07,0:30:25.55,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,要是有辦法收回成命，\N告訴他們「這全是假的」就好了！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:30:25.55,0:30:29.09,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,但那樣也會誤導你們的同伴。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:30:30.38,0:30:35.69,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,不過在此之前，我並不知道\N腳踝上的新月刺青。
Dialogue: 5,0:30:35.69,0:30:38.51,Main-207+,Yasuie,0,0,0,,是它招來了像我這樣的同伴。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:30:52.46,0:30:55.24,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,又不對！我就是做不好！
Dialogue: 5,0:30:55.24,0:30:56.42,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 5,0:30:57.38,0:31:02.28,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,這一路上，你每次打中敵人\N都說「又不對」！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:31:02.28,0:31:04.13,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,你到底想幹什麼？
Dialogue: 5,0:31:04.13,0:31:07.79,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我想用一拳連碰都不碰到\N就把敵人打飛！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:31:07.79,0:31:09.81,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,只要做到那樣……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:31:09.81,0:31:14.02,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我想我就能打穿\N凱多那身硬鱗片！
Dialogue: 5,0:31:14.02,0:31:16.77,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,用一拳連碰都不碰到\N就把敵人打飛……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:31:16.77,0:31:20.60,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,對。不實際試試\N我也不知道行不行。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:31:20.60,0:31:23.10,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,問題是，我以前見過……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:31:24.00,0:31:25.03,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,雷利……
Dialogue: 5,0:31:27.00,0:31:29.36,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,還有那個拿戰斧的傢伙……
Dialogue: 5,0:31:30.49,0:31:32.94,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,都用過同樣的武裝色霸氣。
Dialogue: 5,0:31:32.94,0:31:35.21,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,他們的跟我的到底有什麼不同？！
Dialogue: 5,0:31:35.21,0:31:38.17,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,霸氣想必是外來的概念。
Dialogue: 5,0:31:38.17,0:31:40.21,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你知道些什麼？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:31:40.21,0:31:45.17,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,在和之國，我們運用一種\N源自體內、覆於刀刃的無形之力。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:31:46.08,0:31:49.29,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,一把好刀，需要時\N連鐵都能斬斷，
Dialogue: 5,0:31:49.29,0:31:52.39,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,不需要時，\N連一張紙都劃不破。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:31:52.39,0:31:55.10,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,全憑劍士的心念！
Dialogue: 5,0:32:06.02,0:32:07.49,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,老爺子……！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:32:07.49,0:32:10.36,Main-207+,Alpacaman,0,0,0,,瞧瞧這老頭！\N準備好受死了嗎？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:32:11.32,0:32:13.52,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,草帽大人。
Dialogue: 5,0:32:13.52,0:32:18.81,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,且看我施展這身\N在刀劍生涯中磨練出的本領。
Dialogue: 5,0:32:24.98,0:32:29.52,Thoughts-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,明明是這場變態處刑遊戲的主角，{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:32:29.52,0:32:33.84,Thoughts-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,他卻把它當成了訓練的機會？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:32:35.30,0:32:37.69,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,草帽大人！給我指示！
Dialogue: 5,0:32:38.61,0:32:39.30,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 5,0:32:46.92,0:32:49.57,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,他會使出全力，揮下右手的刀！
Dialogue: 5,0:32:50.31,0:32:51.99,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,我知道了！
Dialogue: 5,0:33:06.08,0:33:08.62,Main-207+,Alpacaman,0,0,0,,該死的老頭！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:33:36.70,0:33:38.25,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,他把他擊退了！
Dialogue: 5,0:33:46.08,0:33:47.17,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,老爺子……{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:33:47.92,0:33:52.12,Main-207+,Prisoner,0,0,0,,豹五郎老爺子撂倒了那個給賦者！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:33:52.12,0:33:53.51,Main-207+,Madilloman,0,0,0,,羊駝人！
Dialogue: 5,0:33:56.53,0:34:01.94,Main-207+,Queen,0,0,0,,那個老弱雞……我發誓\N他都半截入土了。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:34:01.94,0:34:05.06,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,沒想到他竟這麼矯健！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:34:07.68,0:34:09.90,Main-207+,Prisoner,0,0,0,,難道豹五郎老爺子真的是
Dialogue: 5,0:34:09.90,0:34:12.61,Main-207+,Prisoner,0,0,0,,那位赫赫有名的「花」豹五郎？！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:34:15.69,0:34:17.54,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,草帽大人……
Dialogue: 5,0:34:19.15,0:34:23.41,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,若這是你一心想要達成的事，
Dialogue: 5,0:34:24.13,0:34:27.24,Main-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,或許我能助你一臂之力。{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:34:32.51,0:34:34.05,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你一定要教我！{Z}
Dialogue: 5,0:34:35.64,0:34:37.88,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,就是這個！
